---
import Legal from '@/layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '@/site.config';
---
<Legal title="Privacy policy" description="How Idaho Gate Co. collects, uses and protects the information you send through this website, including quote requests, uploads and analytics." path="/privacy/" updated="November 2026">
  <p>This policy explains what {site.name} ("we") collects through {site.domain}, why, and what you can do about it. It is written in plain language on purpose.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <h3>Information you give us</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Quote requests and notes.</strong> Your name, phone number, email address, project city or town, and the answers you choose in the quote form (for example gate type, width, automation and timeline), plus anything you write in the notes.</li>
    <li><strong>Files you upload.</strong> Photos or drawings you attach to a quote request. Photos are reduced in size in your browser before they are sent.</li>
    <li><strong>Calls and emails.</strong> If you call or email us, we receive whatever you share.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>How you found us.</strong> When you arrive, the site stores the page you landed on, the referring site, and any campaign tags in the link (such as utm_source or an ad click ID) in your browser. If you send a quote request, these are sent with it so we know which marketing works.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics.</strong> If analytics tools are enabled, they record pages viewed, buttons used (for example taps on our phone number) and steps completed in the quote form. See "Tools we may use" below.</li>
    <li><strong>Server logs.</strong> Our hosting provider records standard technical data such as IP address, browser type and time of request.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to your request, schedule a site visit and prepare a drawing and quote.</li>
    <li>To deliver, install and service work you hire us to do.</li>
    <li>To understand which pages and campaigns lead to enquiries, so we can improve the site.</li>
    <li>To keep the forms free of spam.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We do not sell your personal information. We do not send marketing email unless you ask us to.</p>

  <h2>Who we share it with</h2>
  <p>Only service providers who help us run the business, and only what they need:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Website hosting.</li>
    <li>The email delivery service that carries quote requests to our inbox.</li>
    <li>A customer management system, if we use one to track requests.</li>
    <li>Analytics and advertising platforms, where enabled, as described below.</li>
    <li>Trade partners on your project, such as an electrician or mason, with your knowledge.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>We may also disclose information where the law requires it.</p>

  <h2>Tools we may use</h2>
  <p>The site is built to work with the following. Each is switched off until we configure it.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Google Analytics and Google Tag Manager</strong> for site usage measurement.</li>
    <li><strong>Google Ads</strong> conversion measurement.</li>
    <li><strong>Meta Pixel</strong> for measuring results from Facebook and Instagram ads.</li>
    <li><strong>Call tracking</strong>, which may show a different phone number depending on how you found us so calls can be attributed to a campaign.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>These tools may set cookies or use similar technology. You can block cookies in your browser settings and use the opt-out tools those companies provide. The site and its forms work without them.</p>

  <h2>Browser storage</h2>
  <p>The site stores a small amount of information in your browser: how you arrived (described above) and, while you fill in the quote form, your answers so they are not lost if the page reloads. You can clear this at any time by clearing site data in your browser.</p>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>We keep quote requests and project records for as long as needed to serve you, meet legal and tax obligations and honor any warranty. If you ask us to delete a request that did not become a project, we will.</p>

  <h2>Security</h2>
  <p>Forms are sent over an encrypted connection. Access to requests is limited to the people who need it. No method of transmission or storage is perfectly secure, so please do not send sensitive information such as gate codes through the website.</p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>You can ask what information we hold about you, ask us to correct it or ask us to delete it. Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights under state law. To make a request, contact us using the details below.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>This site is for adults planning property projects. We do not knowingly collect information from children under 13.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If we change this policy, we will update the date at the top of this page.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>{site.legalName}, {site.contact.region}. Phone <a href={`tel:${site.contact.phoneTel}`}>{site.contact.phoneDisplay}</a>. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
